---
<Layout lang="en" path="/en/services/company-registration-foreigners" title={"Register a Company in Bulgaria as a Foreigner"} description={"How foreigners register an EOOD or OOD in Bulgaria in 2026: documents, registered address, minimum capital of 1 €, remote registration, taxes and residence."} schema={schema}>
<style is:inline>
/* landing pages (VAMIBEX 19.10.2026) */
.mc-landing { color: #1f2937; line-height: 1.7; }
.mc-landing .lp-hero { background: #111827; color: #fff; padding: 64px 20px 56px; }
.mc-landing .lp-wrap { max-width: 980px; margin: 0 auto; }
.mc-landing .lp-hero h1 { font-size: 2.3rem; line-height: 1.2; margin: 0 0 16px; color: #fff; }
.mc-landing .lp-hero p { font-size: 1.1rem; color: #e5e7eb; margin: 0 0 24px; max-width: 760px; }
.mc-landing .lp-actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; }
.mc-landing .lp-btn { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-height: 48px; padding: 0 24px; border-radius: 10px; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; }
.mc-landing .lp-btn--main { background: #d00000; color: #fff; }
.mc-landing .lp-btn--ghost { border: 2px solid #fff; color: #fff; }
.mc-landing .lp-trust { list-style: none; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px 20px; padding: 0; margin: 18px 0 0; font-weight: 600; }
.mc-landing .lp-trust li::before { content: "✓"; margin-right: 6px; color: #22c55e; font-weight: 800; }
.mc-landing .lp-sec { padding: 48px 20px 8px; }
.mc-landing .lp-sec h2 { font-size: 1.6rem; margin: 0 0 16px; color: #111827; }
.mc-landing .lp-sec h3 { font-size: 1.1rem; margin: 22px 0 6px; color: #111827; }
.mc-landing .lp-list { padding-left: 22px; }
.mc-landing .lp-list li { margin: 0 0 8px; }
.mc-landing .lp-steps { counter-reset: s; list-style: none; padding: 0; display: grid; gap: 14px; }
.mc-landing .lp-steps li { counter-increment: s; position: relative; padding: 14px 16px 14px 60px; background: #f9fafb; border-radius: 12px; }
.mc-landing .lp-steps li::before { content: counter(s); position: absolute; left: 16px; top: 14px; width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; background: #d00000; color: #fff; font-weight: 800; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; }
.mc-landing .lp-related a { color: #d00000; }
.mc-landing .lp-cta { margin: 48px 20px 64px; padding: 32px 24px; background: #fef2f2; border-radius: 16px; text-align: center; }
.mc-landing .lp-cta h2 { margin: 0 0 10px; font-size: 1.5rem; color: #111827; }
.mc-landing .lp-cta p { margin: 0 0 18px; }
.mc-landing .lp-cta .lp-btn--ghost { border-color: #d00000; color: #d00000; }
.mc-landing .lp-cta .lp-actions { justify-content: center; }
@media (max-width: 600px) {
  .mc-landing .lp-hero { padding: 44px 16px 40px; }
  .mc-landing .lp-hero h1 { font-size: 1.8rem; }
  .mc-landing .lp-btn { width: 100%; }
}
</style>
<main class="mc-landing">
<section class="lp-hero"><div class="lp-wrap">
<h1>Company Registration in Bulgaria for Foreigners</h1>
<p>Bulgaria lets foreign citizens – from the EU and from outside it – own and manage a limited company. We prepare the documents, register the company and keep its accounts from the first day.</p>
<div class="lp-actions"><a class="lp-btn lp-btn--main" href="tel:+359879884488">Call +359 879 88 44 88</a><a class="lp-btn lp-btn--ghost" href="/en/contact#contact-form">Get a free quote</a></div>
<!-- mc-hero-call (VAMIBEX 20.10.2026) -->
<p class="mc-hero-call" style="margin: 14px 0 0; font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.5; opacity: 0.92; max-width: 640px;">Contact Doychin Mehov. Tell him briefly what you need – he will explain the next steps and you will get a quote.</p>
<!-- mc-hero-price (VAMIBEX 20.10.2026) -->
<p class="mc-hero-price" style="margin: 10px 0 0; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5; font-weight: 700; max-width: 640px;">Company registration 179 €</p>
<ul class="lp-trust"><li>You talk directly to Doychin Mehov</li><li>Office in Sofia, Darvenitsa</li><li>Over 25 years of experience</li><li>Written replies in English</li></ul>
</div></section>
<section class="lp-sec"><div class="lp-wrap">
<h2>What you need</h2>
<ul class="lp-list"><li>A valid passport of every owner and manager</li><li>A registered office address in Bulgaria (you do not need a personal address here)</li><li>Documents signed abroad – power of attorney, specimen signature, declarations – with an apostille or legalisation and a certified Bulgarian translation</li><li>A minimum share capital of 1 €, paid into a Bulgarian bank account</li></ul>
</div></section>
<section class="lp-sec"><div class="lp-wrap">
<h2>How it works</h2>
<ol class="lp-steps"><li>We discuss the legal form (EOOD or OOD), the business activity and the address</li><li>We prepare the documents and tell you which ones to sign and certify</li><li>You sign in Bulgaria or abroad with a notarised power of attorney; the bank may ask to meet the owner once</li><li>We file with the Commercial Register and, if needed, register the company for VAT</li></ol>
</div></section>
<section class="lp-sec lp-faq"><div class="lp-wrap">
<h2>Frequently asked questions</h2>
<h3>Can a non-EU citizen own and manage a Bulgarian company?</h3>
<p>Yes. Citizenship is not a restriction for owning or managing an EOOD or OOD. You do not need a Bulgarian co-owner or a Bulgarian manager.</p>
<h3>Can the registration be done remotely?</h3>
<p>In most cases yes, through a notarised power of attorney with an apostille and a certified translation. Banks may require the owner to appear in person once to open the account.</p>
<h3>What taxes does a Bulgarian company pay?</h3>
<p>Corporate income tax is 10%. Dividends paid to individuals are taxed at 5%. VAT is 20%, and VAT registration is mandatory once taxable turnover in a calendar year exceeds 51 130 €.</p>
<h3>Does owning a company give me the right to live in Bulgaria?</h3>
<p>No, not by itself. Owning or managing a company from abroad does not require a residence permit, but living in Bulgaria does. The conditions depend on your situation – Doychin Mehov will explain them when you talk.</p>
</div></section>
<section class="lp-sec lp-related"><div class="lp-wrap">
<h2>Related</h2>
<ul class="lp-list"><li><a href="/en/services/company-registration">Company registration in Bulgaria – EOOD, OOD</a></li><li><a href="/en/services/accounting">Accounting services in Sofia</a></li></ul>
</div></section>
<section class="lp-cta"><div class="lp-wrap">
<h2>Planning to start a company in Bulgaria?</h2>
<p>Write to us and we will reply with a concrete quote. Office in Sofia, Darvenitsa District; we also work remotely.</p>
<div class="lp-actions"><a class="lp-btn lp-btn--main" href="tel:+359879884488">Call +359 879 88 44 88</a><a class="lp-btn lp-btn--ghost" href="/en/contact#contact-form">Get a free quote</a></div>
</div></section>
</main> 
